'The three target Map refusals clear. The head also clears `reading recursionIdentityMap` at 311:38. `dumpTypes` remains blocked, first at 232:19 (`a value of type any`). No new tracing findings appear. The full-mode pair counts eight cleared ledger entries: four NotYet findings and four recovery boundaries.','',
